# Getting in and out of a pilot's seat with the hands: grip the seat to sit, hold Y to get up.
# The VR controls switch to the ship's set while seated and back to on-foot after.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- Setup: a LargeBlockCockpitSeat of our own, built before the character (Earth Planet ships none standing free) --------
admin creativeTools
# out of the starter base, where nothing is built within 10 m, to build there
goto open
build LargeBlockCockpitSeat 3 as TestPilotSeat
# Stand inside the block's cell, facing it. A large seat's centre is below the eyes, so the hand reaches down-forward.
goto TestPilotSeat 1.0
wait 2
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.2 -0.3
hand right 0 1.3 -0.6
wait 1

# ---- Before: on foot, not in any seat ------------------------------------------------------------------------
read character
expect state != sitting
expect controlledEntity == null

# ---- Reach the seat with the right hand and grip: the game's Use, so the character sits ------------------------
# (Hand coordinates are a first guess; the log line "Grab use: Right palm ... box middle at tracking x,y,z" says where
# the seat's use spot is, head-relative, to tune them.)
press right grip
wait 1.5
release right grip
wait 1

# ---- After: seated in the block, and the hands' controls are the ship's ------------------------------------------
read character
expect state == sitting
expect controlledEntity.type == MyCockpit
expect log VR controls: ship controller (Cockpit) within 5
# The seat holds the head round the pilot's head; the plugin says so a second after sitting down.
expect log Seat clamp: in LargeBlockCockpitSeat within 5

# ---- Leave: hold Y (left B) for half a second, the game's Use held, which leaves the seat -----------------------
press left b
wait 0.8
release left b
wait 1.5
read character
expect state != sitting
expect controlledEntity == null
expect log VR controls: on foot within 5
